00:00:49.708 --> 00:00:51.041
- Prompt you?
- Yeah.

00:00:51.041 --> 00:00:53.417
- The go long or sell.

00:00:53.417 --> 00:00:58.542
- Right, so being a founder
or being an entrepeneur

00:00:58.542 --> 00:01:01.458
is an intensely
personal decision.

00:01:01.458 --> 00:01:02.250
- Yeah.

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:05.667
- You're also balancing
lots of different interests.

00:01:05.667 --> 00:01:08.041
You're balancing interests
of your investors,

00:01:08.041 --> 00:01:09.625
you're balancing interests
of your partners,

00:01:09.625 --> 00:01:11.458
you're balancing interests
of your board of directors,

00:01:11.458 --> 00:01:12.375
and your employees.

00:01:12.375 --> 00:01:13.959
But ultimately at it's heart,

00:01:13.959 --> 00:01:15.959
it's an intensely
personal decision,

00:01:15.959 --> 00:01:17.792
and with one of those decisions

00:01:17.792 --> 00:01:20.792
only the person can make it.

00:01:20.792 --> 00:01:23.041
So you may make the right
one or the wrong one,

00:01:23.041 --> 00:01:25.333
but it's intensely
personal at it's core,

00:01:25.333 --> 00:01:27.000
and it's really hard for
someone on the outside

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:28.750
to make the investor,
like us, to say

00:01:28.750 --> 00:01:30.583
"come on man, go for it."

00:01:30.583 --> 00:01:33.041
'Cause we have
diversified portfolios

00:01:33.041 --> 00:01:34.708
of investments and businesses,

00:01:34.708 --> 00:01:36.083
and in fact if you
think about the concept

00:01:36.083 --> 00:01:37.166
of a diversified portfolio,

00:01:37.166 --> 00:01:38.708
I say this to
founders all the time,

00:01:38.708 --> 00:01:42.458
the success of your
individual business or company

00:01:42.458 --> 00:01:45.500
doesn't really affect me.

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:48.834
What affects me is the
diversification of 24 companies

00:01:48.834 --> 00:01:52.625
that I invest in over a four
year period out of one fund.

00:01:52.625 --> 00:01:54.625
That's all you have,

00:01:54.625 --> 00:01:56.500
and I'm constructing a
diversified portfolio

00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:57.875
that I know 60 to 70 percent

00:01:57.875 --> 00:01:59.625
are probably not going
to return the money,

00:01:59.625 --> 00:02:01.500
and 20 to 30 percent
will return my capital,

00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:04.417
and one or two will deliver
those outside returns.

00:02:04.417 --> 00:02:07.458
So in that balance,
that's not equal,

00:02:07.458 --> 00:02:10.041
how can you say to someone,
"you should go for it"?

00:02:10.041 --> 00:02:12.500
- So would you back Doug again,

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:15.250
