00:02:18.708 --> 00:02:20.583
because that's a great set of
experiences.

00:02:20.583 --> 00:02:22.875
Most first time entrepreneurs
don't have an experience

00:02:22.875 --> 00:02:24.250
to build a company.

00:02:24.250 --> 00:02:26.625
Having to raise outside
capital, how to sell it.

00:02:26.625 --> 00:02:27.583
Have to balance those,

00:02:27.583 --> 00:02:31.667
 that could be 
good set of experiences.

00:02:31.667 --> 00:02:34.583
- So we're talking
about a company

00:02:34.583 --> 00:02:36.959
that got a very,
very early offer.

00:02:36.959 --> 00:02:38.959
- We talked about it.

00:02:38.959 --> 00:02:40.208
