of wine for 20 minutes.

00:05:47.125 --> 00:05:48.875
(laughing)

00:05:48.875 --> 00:05:50.250
And a lot of people watched that

00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:52.667
and that's how I hit the
scene in the tech world,

00:05:52.667 --> 00:05:55.000
and then what happened
was YouTube sold

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:57.500
for $1.7 billion,

00:05:57.500 --> 00:06:00.083
and I was like fuck,
I was right about e-com,

00:06:00.083 --> 00:06:01.959
I was right about
Google AdWords,

00:06:01.959 --> 00:06:06.125
I was right about cookie
retargeting banner ads,

00:06:06.125 --> 00:06:07.583
I was right about YouTube.

00:06:07.583 --> 00:06:09.083
Maybe this skill I have

00:06:09.083 --> 00:06:12.667
for selling more
Burgundy and Priorat

00:06:12.667 --> 00:06:14.375
